### Phase 5 — Reports API smoke tests
# Get a token from the browser console on the running client while signed in:
#   await window.Clerk.session.getToken()
# Tokens are short-lived (~60s), so refresh when you get 401.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@citizenToken = paste_citizen_token_here

### Categories (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories

### Reports feed (public) — newest first, page 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports?page=1&pageSize=10&sort=newest

### Reports feed filtered by category + status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports?category=pothole&status=reported

### Map points (public, capped at 1000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/map

### Report detail (public)
# Replace with a real id once 003_seed.sql has been run.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### City Health stats (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/public

### --- Everything below requires a citizen token ---

### Sign upload URLs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "count": 1, "contentType": "image/jpeg" }

### Nearby duplicate check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/nearby-duplicates?lat=21.1458&lng=79.0882&category=pothole
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Create a report (imagePaths from the /uploads/sign step above, after the real upload)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Large pothole near MG Road bus stop",
  "description": "Causes traffic issues, needs immediate repair.",
  "category": "pothole",
  "severity": 3,
  "lat": 21.1458,
  "lng": 79.0882,
  "areaName": "MG Road, Ward 5",
  "imagePaths": ["reports/user_xxx/replace-with-real-path.jpg"]
}

### Toggle upvote (run twice to see it flip)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/upvote
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Add a comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Same issue near the bus stop, please prioritize." }

### Delete own comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### My reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### My notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Mark all notifications read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/read
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "all": true }

### Mark one notification read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/read
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }

### --- Validation / error-shape checks ---

### Missing required field → 422 with details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x" }

### Unknown category slug → 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports?category=not-a-real-category

### No token on a citizen route → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{}
